# Pump Controller Driver Configuration

config PUMP_CONTROLLER
    bool "Aygu Pump Controller Driver"
    default y
    depends on GPIO
    help
      Enable the Aygu pump controller driver with integrated state management
      and safety timers.

config PUMP_CONTROLLER_INIT_PRIORITY
    int "Pump Controller init priority"
    default 40
    depends on PUMP_CONTROLLER
    help
      Init priority for pump controller driver.